## 英文摘要 / English Summary

This project is licensed under the MIT License (see `LICENSE`).

Third-party components redistributed in this repository:

| Component | Location | Author | License |
|---|---|---|---|
| Pyxel (game engine) | dependency, not vendored | Takashi Kitao | MIT |
| `audio_bgm1.ogg` | `assets/audio/bgm1.ogg` | Takashi Kitao | MIT |
| `audio_bgm2.ogg` | `assets/audio/bgm2.ogg` | Takashi Kitao | MIT |
| Ark Pixel Font 12px | `assets/fonts/ark-pixel-12px-monospaced-zh_hans.ttf` | TakWolf | OFL 1.1 |

The two `.ogg` files are byte-for-byte copies of the sample music shipped with the
official Pyxel distribution (MIT, © Takashi Kitao), renamed only for convenience.

**One open-source font is bundled:** `assets/fonts/ark-pixel-12px-monospaced-zh_hans.ttf`
(Ark Pixel Font 12px, by TakWolf, SIL Open Font License 1.1 - see
`assets/fonts/OFL.txt`). It is a hand-designed 12px pixel CJK font, which is why it
renders sharply at this project's 240x216 resolution.

Microsoft system fonts (`simhei.ttf` and relatives) remain **not distributed**; they
are only consulted as a fallback chain if the bundled font is missing. The game no
longer requires a Windows system font in order to start.

All pixel art under `src/assets_gen/` is procedurally generated from character-art
source files written for this project; the source code is the asset source.
